  "title": "Storage Tips for Businesses and Commercial Operations",
  "summary": "Smart storage strategies can transform commercial operations, reduce costs, and improve efficiency. Whether managing inventory, documents, or equipment, these proven approaches help businesses maximize space and streamline workflows. Audit Your Storage Needs Regularly Conduct quarterly assessments of what you&#8217;re storing and why. Many businesses accumulate items that no longer serve operational needs. Create clear retention policies for documents, inventory, and equipment [...]",
